{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/8268e1c80751226084d4a7c276993932.webp?t=1754387139\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What began as the ultimate sci-fi blockbuster has spiraled into an uncontrollable real-life crisis and now it's up to you to salvage the production, protect the crew and locals, and stop what was a cinematic dream from becoming a total disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/f2fda931608356cbd2f8b769b055f516.avif?t=1754387139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take charge as the chaos rises around you. The scripted alien invasion has somehow become terrifyingly real: robots have turned rogue, practical effects are out of control, and experimental technology now threatens not just the film but the entire ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinate emergency teams, and calm panicked actors while battling sandstorms, quicksand, electrical anomalies and other hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/81b06d2f122237cee2abefcb6847780a.avif?t=1754387139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As tempers flare and egos explode, betrayal brews behind the scenes. Someone has gone too far and they\u2019re now threatening to sabotage the entire project. Can you expose the truth?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/276d996befbdda4edd3b897e5ee3608e.webp?t=1754387139\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Rescue Team: Lights. Camera. Outer Space, as in any time management game, you\u2019ll need to carefully plan your time for building, gathering resources, and using bonuses at the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a wide variety of buildings and unique items. Collect them to complete tasks and take part in exciting adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble a team of rescuers, take on diverse missions to save people and animals, restore buildings, extinguish fires \u2014 and most importantly, uncover what really happened on the movie set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/9483246dc35ddcd34242b5cf181499ec.avif?t=1754387139\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/3382f4a68459c146536defdcfc79fd9d.webp?t=1754387139\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">65 levels to complete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step-by-step level guide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catchy downloadable Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful desktop wallpapers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade equipment, level up heroes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find all the film reels for the Editing Room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/5791b93a20234a64fb5a88a2d91cf3db.avif?t=1754387139\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904710?t=1754387139","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/b1d8a34cc7cf3a2e98f5eecb5bc7d08fa6d50f98/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754387139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/1e0e5ee7b5afb1f2f37b1188bac558326ed35da9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754387139","capsule_